  "$comment": "FIT-13 number budget. Every implemented number is a code constant (or a literal SQL interval) that is also quoted in docs/police/architecture/{05-nfr,02-state-machines,09-outbox}.md. kind=implemented requires a code pattern and at least one doc pattern; kind=proposed means the doc may state a target that the code does not implement yet (audit retention is the current example). Each doc ref captures the value with its own regex; every match must equal `value` after applying `scale`. A doc or code drift fails tests/architecture/test_number_budget.py. Paths are relative to the repository root.",
